1. Remove All Stopped Containers
docker container prune -f
2. Remove All Unused Images
docker image prune -a -f
3. Remove Everything (Most Powerful)
docker system prune -a --volumes -f
6. Remove Volumes (Optional)
docker volume prune -f

1. Pull the image
docker pull sadik789diwan/cloudapp:latest
2. Run the container
docker run -p 8080:8080 sadik789diwan/cloudapp:latest



